<title>JAPAN: Daito Mechatronics - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daito Mechatronics - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to October 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.00		vs	    6.30</p>
<p> Operating	   79    million    vs	  151    million</p>
<p> Current	     88    million    vs	  128    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 226    million    vs	 prft 66 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 64.53 yen	  vs    prft 18.90 yen</p>
<p> Shares		4 million	  vs	   3 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Daito Mechatronics Co Ltd is a retailer of electronic machinery and parts.</p>
